# Files that are permanently a fork's own, once forked — never overwritten by
# merging in updates from this repo. Requires the one-time setup in FORKING.md
# ("git config merge.ours.driver true"); without it these lines are inert and
# git falls back to a normal merge.
#
# Scope is deliberately narrow: only files that are *entirely* personal
# content, never code that also needs to keep receiving fixes. tokens.css, for
# example, is not listed here — its color palette lives in a block separate
# from component styles, so a normal line-based merge already keeps a fork's
# colors while still picking up styling fixes.
content/*.md merge=ours
content/recipes/** merge=ours
public/portrait-hero.jpg merge=ours
public/og.jpg merge=ours
src/app/icon.png merge=ours
src/app/apple-icon.png merge=ours
src/site.config.ts merge=ours
PLAN.md merge=ours
